                >
                  <MaterialSymbolsElectricBolt width="14" height="14" />
                  Boost Your Listing
                </a>
              </div>

              <!-- Partner Announcements -->
              <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-1">
                  📢 Partner Announcements
                </h3>
                
                <div class="space-y-3">
                  <!-- Nomadicards -->
                  <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-3 last:border-b-0">
                    <p class="text-orange-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Community · Free Handover</p>
                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Nomadicards is Looking for a New Home</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2 leading-relaxed">Nomadicards has been on the road for a while now — passed around colivings, pulled out at dinner tables, and used to spark the kind of conversations that make nomad communities feel like home. And the feedback has always been the same: the cards work. Right now though, Nomadicards is a bit… homeless 😅 I'd love for the project to find a new home and a new life — someone who sees its potential and would enjoy helping it reach more coliving spaces, experiment with new editions, and maybe even include questions proposed by the community itself. If that someone might be you, I'd be happy to hand Nomadicards over at no cost. This was never a money project for me — I just want to see it stay alive and shared. If this resonates, feel free to reach out ❤️ — Francesco</p>
                    <a href="mailto:francesco@nomadicards.com" class="text-xs text-blue-300 hover:text-blue-200 underline">Get Email →</a>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Casa Marianas -->
                  <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-3 last:border-b-0">
                    <p class="text-orange-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Opportunity · Saipan, Pacific</p>
                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Casa Marianas - Live/Work Social Media Manager</h4>
